//! The dock's action icons, drawn in whichever folder icon set the user
//! chose (Options → Icon) so the dock and the sidebar match. A set that
//! lacks a drawing borrows the Boxicons one, like the tag icons do.
//!
//! GENERATED by `tools/dock_icons.py` from the Iconify collections — do not
//! hand-edit the bodies; change the table in the script and regenerate.

